    description: "Orochi is a deity whose purpose is to protect Gaia, considering
      itself an extension of the earth itself. Unlike a typical antagonist, its actions
      are driven by philosophy rather than malice\u2014it believes humanity\u2019s
      destruction is a necessary step to restore natural balance, not an end in itself."
